{
  "swagger": "2.0",
  "info": {
    "description": "FSC API — **Channel Backend (orchestrator) view**. Scoped from `1.5-merged` by removing endpoints the Channel Backend does NOT call right now: **POST /family/save**, **POST /member/save**, **DELETE /member/delete**, **POST /member/role/update** (family & member provisioning is owned by the provisioning path, not the orchestrator) and **POST /alarm/sos/kill** (Network-internal, per 17-Nov decision #8 — orchestrator does not persist). Remaining surface = reads + trigger operations + consolidated history the orchestrator actually consumes: alarm/incoming, device/status/fetch, family/get, member/get, trigger/checkin(+status), trigger/sos(+cancel+status), history/fetch. Response envelope (responseCode, responseMessage, transactionId) unchanged.",
    "version": "1.6-channel-backend",
    "title": "FSC API — Channel Backend view",
    "termsOfService": "urn:tos",
    "contact": {},
    "license": {
      "name": "Apache 2.0",
      "url": "http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0"
    }
  },
